    "title": "Weapons of Mass Destruction Label on Illicit Fentanyl Targets Drug Source: Researcher | NTD",
    "text": "President Donald Trump has designated fentanyl and its core precursor chemical as weapons of mass destruction. The move paves the way for enhancing criminal sentences, crippling financial structures, and bolstering national security resources to disrupt those responsible for trafficking the deadly drug into the United States. NTD hears insight into this from Steve Yates, senior research fellow for China and National Security at the Heritage Foundation.\nWeapons of Mass Destruction Label on Illicit Fentanyl Targets Drug Source: Researcher\nSteve Yates, a senior research fellow, discussed President Donald Trump's designation of fentanyl and a core precursor chemical as weapons of mass destruction.\n|\nPublished: 12/17/2025, 11:46:03 PM EST",
